Phase 1 — Backend foundation
NestJS, Docker PostgreSQL, Drizzle, env local, Swagger, API prefix, aliases, base modules.

Phase 2 — Auth & users
Login by bacYear + matricule + password, roles: ADMIN, ENSEIGNANT, ETUDIANT.

Phase 3 — Formations
Admin creates formations, assigns teacher, price, start/end date, capacity, stop sale.

Phase 4 — Enrollments
Student sees catalogue, enrolls, cannot enroll if sale closed/full/already enrolled.

Phase 5 — Dashboards
Admin stats, teacher assigned formations, student enrolled formations.

Phase 6 — Calendar
Return formation dates as calendar events.

Phase 7 — Notifications
Mock email service: notify teacher/admin after student enrollment.

Phase 8 — Optional
Progress tracking, certificates/badges.